  "prefLabel": "Rev 1612.04 Form DP-139, Communications Services Tax Application for Registration Number",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Rev 1612.04 Form DP-139, Communications Services Tax Application for Registration Number. Form DP-139, communications services tax application for registration number, shall be completed and filed by retailers and customers to apply for a communications services tax registration number.\n\nSource. #6336, eff 9-24-96 (from Rev 1612); ss and moved by #8178, eff 9-24-04 (from Rev 1611.06); ss by #10213, eff 10-24-12 (from Rev 1611.06); renumbered by #13002 (formerly Rev 1611.05); ss by #13553, eff 2-7-23 (formerly Rev 1612.05) (see Revision Note at chapter heading for Rev 1600)",
